# moby-subtick-corpus.manifest - rows of tests/harness/check_moby_subtick.sh.
#   <bk2> | <lo>-<hi> | pairs=<n> class=<n> [dmax=<px>] [| leg|seam <vbl> <moby> <reason>]...
#   bk2    a movie under games/spyro-3/bk2
#   span   intermediate-capture VBLs, two apart; exclusions name the VBL the
#          [moby-anim] trace prints
# Sheila (class 0x39) blends from animation 1 into 3 and from 3 into 14
# (switches at trace VBLs 5072 and 5086); two class 0x7e NPCs walk and switch
# animation at 5082, 5106 and 5114.
# Two class legs are left out of the seam bound, each with its tuple exact;
# both are the translation term alone. At 5106 the class 0x7e NPC turns
# (rotation byte 0x5e to 0x63) while it switches clip: its rotation sweeps, and
# the seam (0.32, 0.08) px is the step of the view-space translation (4.91,
# 1.59, -0.95) at depth 5808 projected with H = 340 +- 30, and reads 0.330
# against the moby's 0.281. At 5110 the centroid step (-0.750, -0.080) px equals H times the step
# of the view-space translation over its depth, and 0.11 px remains against the
# moby's 0.19.
sheilas-alp-sheila-water-invisible.bk2 | 5063-5129 | pairs=195 class=18 | seam 5106 801697e4 translation floor of the record replay | seam 5110 80169734 translation floor of the record replay
# Sunny Villa area 2 (skateboard hologram): the class 0x1ce record spins 8
# byte angles per tick on its Y euler byte before a static freecam. The two
# class 0x1cd records are left out: their record frame word stays fixed while
# the animation state the tuple rebuilds from steps.
pose:sunny_villa:2:pos=(189567, 68825, 19072) yaw=-2031 pitch=197 | 1773-1803 | pairs=30 turn=14 | leg 1776 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1776 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1778 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1778 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1780 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1780 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1782 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1782 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1784 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1784 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1786 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1786 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1788 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1788 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1790 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1790 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1792 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1792 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1794 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1794 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1796 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1796 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1798 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1798 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1800 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1800 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1802 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1802 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1804 801834dc class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open | leg 1804 80183534 class 0x1cd record frame word fixed while its animation state steps, open
# Sheila (class 0x39) turns 8 byte angles per tick through trace VBL 4636;
# the turn bin requires her rotation to sweep.
sheilas-alp-sheila-water-invisible.bk2 | 4629-4641 | pairs=43 turn=6 | seam 4632 8016a54c class leg above the non-class bound, open, outside the turn bin | seam 4634 80169d0c class leg above the non-class bound, open, outside the turn bin | seam 4638 80169d0c class leg above the non-class bound, open, outside the turn bin | seam 4638 801677ec class leg above the non-class bound, open, outside the turn bin | seam 4642 80169cb4 class leg with no non-class leg in the span, open, outside the turn bin
# Sunrise Spring egg (class 0x084, record replay) before a freecam turning 4
# yaw units per tick from the reported pose, engaged at VBL 2463: the egg's
# world position and angle word are fixed, so every leg is a still leg.
pose:sunrise_spring:pos=(28471, 32424, 18245) yaw=-1727 pitch=183 | 2473-2533 | pairs=0 spin=4 still=25
# The attract demo: mobys 8018e278, 8018e328, 8018e380 and 8018fda0 cross
# world buckets between ticks; a base taken at the newest tick's position
# words reads 175 of 917 alpha-0 bases 1 to 3 buckets off the stored one. The
# class leg at 5819 (D 0.014 px against the moby's 0.010) is left out of the
# seam bound, open.
attract | 5700-5860 | pairs=726 class=43 wbase=209 | seam 5819 8018e328 class leg above the non-class bound, open
# Evening Lake: the whale, class 0x10c, has bit 30 set in its colour word, so
# the cull composes 12-bit angles byte<<4 | nibble out of that word
# (mobydraw.s:227-228, 643-647, 708-712, 775-778); it banks and turns a few
# 12-bit units per tick along its flight loop.
pose:evening_lake:pos=(49300, 52390, 20500) yaw=1100 pitch=108 | 1891-1931 | pairs=40 turn=19
